# Root build context is used by the promo-worker image only
# (all other services build from their own subdirectory).
# The repo root is ~2.5GB (frontend node_modules, caches, prototypes),
# so exclude everything except what the worker Dockerfile COPYs.
# Without this, `docker compose build promo-worker` uploads gigabytes
# to the daemon and appears to hang at "exporting" with no output.

**
!apps/
!apps/erp/
!apps/erp/backend/
!apps/erp/backend/requirements.txt
!apps/erp/backend/app/
!apps/erp/backend/app/**
!apps/erp/backend/alembic.ini
!infrastructure/
!infrastructure/promo-templates/
!infrastructure/promo-templates/**

# Re-exclude weight inside the kept trees (caches, tests, local state).
apps/erp/backend/app/**/__pycache__/
apps/erp/backend/app/**/__pycache__/**
*.pyc
*.pyo
